{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00563","headline":"郊庙歌辞 蜡百神乐章 肃和 · 不详","name":"郊庙歌辞 蜡百神乐章 肃和","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"序迫岁阴，日躔星纪。\n爰稽茂典，聿崇清祀。\n绮币霞舒，瑞珪虹起。\n百禩垂裕，万灵荐祉。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"不详","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_00563.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00563","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}